Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.33,0:00:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Miwa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.25,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Miwa, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Momo...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.63,0:00:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Momo"?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.97,0:00:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, call me whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.93,0:00:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How about... Momotaro?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.93,0:00:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.31,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.81,0:00:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was... molested.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.01,0:00:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.61,0:00:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the same person every day.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.03,0:00:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, I {screwed}gathered up my courage and grabbed his arm.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.78,0:00:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouted for help.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did it work out?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.66,0:00:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Everyone around us pinned him down for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.62,0:00:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.13,0:00:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But why me? I'm not even that feminine.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.67,0:00:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.97,0:00:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.55,0:01:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.97,0:01:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.18,0:01:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that guy was an executive at my dad's company.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.73,0:01:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.90,0:01:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad got fired.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.65,0:01:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom asked why I couldn't just put up with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She said being groped just shows how cute I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.87,0:01:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That he picked me because I'm so cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:34.75,0:01:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. None of that is your fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.13,0:01:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.13,0:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.22,0:01:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.07,0:01:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You have broad shoulders.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.24,0:02:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.45,0:03:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.46,0:03:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just run away!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.17,0:03:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What else am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.04,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've got to fight!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.63,0:03:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't in this mist!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.41,0:03:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, on my own...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.47,0:03:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.27,0:03:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.78,0:04:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.40,0:04:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you use this for something?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.78,0:04:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Penlights?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.95,0:04:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.47,0:04:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This'll do it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Come at me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.86,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to touch you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.57,0:04:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Adults can tell!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.24,0:04:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me how much you want it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just touch your wife!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.20,0:04:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You got married because you love each other!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.41,0:05:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out already!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.83,0:05:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.71,0:05:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.22,0:05:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.39,0:05:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.26,0:05:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!{TODO too fast?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.31,0:05:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you rather be?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.73,0:05:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Skewered, or turned to stone?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.32,0:05:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.32,0:05:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Skewered it is, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Females have expiration dates!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.58,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Momotaro!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come out.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.00,0:05:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a perverted brat who loves being touched.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.86,0:05:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on; I'll make you feel {\i1}real {\i0}good.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.88,0:05:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.05,0:05:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can touch me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Miko, Mako.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:07.11,0:06:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this song?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.23,0:06:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A real Yu-Yu fan couldn't skewer another fan
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.07,0:06:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,while Yu-Yu is watching!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.95,0:06:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, raise the penlights!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.99,0:06:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave them!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.45,0:06:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.47,0:06:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Mako!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.26,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.56,0:06:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to go after her!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.48,0:06:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually excited.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.27,0:06:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It was, like, thrilling and suspenseful.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.44,0:06:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.78,0:06:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you did it because I'm cute, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.54,0:06:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.66,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we understand each other.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.21,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.04,0:07:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.09,0:07:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Be gentle, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.51,0:07:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hands up.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.93,0:07:23.68,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Touch me.{TODO brain or no?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.07,0:07:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really mad!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.05,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.64,0:08:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.93,0:08:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die than be with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.61,0:08:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Women... are quick to deceive.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.87,0:08:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.74,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.00,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brats are all just prey to adults!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hit you with a shot to the heart!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.52,0:08:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.10,0:08:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're immortal in this world.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.23,0:08:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we get fixed over time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.20,0:09:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.82,0:09:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.49,0:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.83,0:09:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We a unit again?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.58,0:09:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.29,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go colorfully?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.50,0:09:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to go colorfully?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.55,0:09:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.65,0:09:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And that!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.78,0:09:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.12,0:09:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.18,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You overdid it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.70,0:10:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just {a}one day, but I fell in love with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.17,0:10:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad that I got to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.34,0:10:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I stay like this until I disappear?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beat.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.28,0:11:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! She's getting warmer.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.03,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We've become fans of you two!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally! I'd come running to see your debut.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.87,0:11:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. I'm not having a debut.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.78,0:11:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're your number one fans.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.67,0:11:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.18,0:11:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just too soon to discharge you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.51,0:11:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting your muscles back in shape takes time.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.11,0:11:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You got out early, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.58,0:11:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you and the Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.29,0:11:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems like fighting there puts \Na heavy strain on our bodies.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.54,0:11:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Like high-altitude training?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.67,0:12:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.67,0:12:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, I think \NI've gotten some definition on my abs.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.42,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not join a sports club and test them out?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.93,0:12:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you don't go to school, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.35,0:12:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like school is all there is.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.48,0:12:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But my mom expects me to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.69,0:12:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't go to school either.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.07,0:12:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one complains?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.28,0:12:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.90,0:12:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.58,0:12:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to next?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.20,0:12:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd go buy an Egg.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I join you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.04,0:12:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.54,0:12:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Neiru?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.08,0:12:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to make a stop first.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.88,0:12:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.43,0:12:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, about Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.60,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not so bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.35,0:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.31,0:13:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess she's contrarian, or her \Nattitude doesn't match her feelings.{TODO what}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she out to get her "wallet" back?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.82,0:13:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.19,0:13:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just what she says. I think.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.08,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It's huge. {TODO brain?}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.30,0:13:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dad's work?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.68,0:13:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trusting, Ai. You forgive easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.97,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, what I said?{TODO jeez}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.94,0:13:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so. I'm hopeless that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.65,0:13:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lovely that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.78,0:13:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless {\i1}and{\i0} lovely that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.57,0:13:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We need someone like that \Nsometimes, or we'll never be saved.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.74,0:13:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Ma'am.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.54,0:14:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. This is my friend, Ohto Ai.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my first secretary, Tanabe Misaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.30,0:14:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ms. Ohto.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.84,0:14:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your recovery, President.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.17,0:14:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.47,0:14:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,President?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.23,0:14:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There are other girls tackling Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.19,0:14:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Like who?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.11,0:14:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A sunflower, I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a bit eccentric,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.95,0:14:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but they're all good kids. Try to make friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.62,0:14:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A sunflower, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.24,0:14:40.33,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You've never eaten French fries?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.16,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.16,0:14:44.96,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,They're crunchy and super tasty when they're hot.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.96,0:14:46.96,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Not so great cold, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.96,0:14:48.04,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.04,0:14:53.28,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,{\t(3277,5196,\c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\4c&H010101&)}Oh, but you know, there's a trick \Nto reheating them in the oven.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.47,0:14:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a women-only car!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.22,0:15:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid man! If you want to ride, get it out!{TODO uhh}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.44,0:15:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll chop it off for you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.73,0:15:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a right to ride in this car, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you trying to say?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.49,0:15:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saying
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm a girl, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.95,0:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.03,0:15:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.13,0:15:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Momotaro.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.17,0:15:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My real name is Momoe. Sawaki Momoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.42,0:15:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a girl, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to trick you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.80,0:15:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think a masculine style suits me better?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.56,0:15:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.64,0:15:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're a girl, I've still fallen in love with you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.31,0:15:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you. I don't want to disappear.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.23,0:15:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.46,0:16:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're warm.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more than you'd think, Haruka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.59,0:16:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Girls like you, who say they love me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.44,0:16:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.68,0:17:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot my wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.85,0:17:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.68,0:17:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I would.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.81,0:17:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't bring it on purpose.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.18,0:17:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My daddy says a beautiful woman shouldn't carry a wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.48,0:17:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, my little wallet's running late.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.07,0:17:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai isn't your wallet.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.24,0:17:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joking.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop. It's not funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.95,0:17:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.30,0:17:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm—
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.76,0:17:44.50,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're handsome!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.10,0:17:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a host!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A host?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.31,0:17:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, there are guys, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.52,0:17:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes sense. Boys kill themselves, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Acca, what's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.44,0:17:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be no boys.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:57.82,0:18:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Boys' and girls' suicides mean different things.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.28,0:18:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are goal-oriented, women are emotion-oriented.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.24,0:18:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are impulsive and easily \Ninfluenced by others' voices.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.04,0:18:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like human relationships?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.71,0:18:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's part of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine a "temptation of death."
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.59,0:18:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A temptation of death?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.63,0:18:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I kind of get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.68,0:18:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Some might be led astray by the temptation and regret it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.47,0:18:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This place exists for those who want to \Nreturn children like that to life.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.22,0:18:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, don't get hung up on gender.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.15,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you shouldn't discriminate!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.98,0:18:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.84,0:19:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.18,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.64,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.27,0:19:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.73,0:19:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, {how do I look}what do I look like to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.03,0:19:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a crying girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.69,0:19:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.03,0:19:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A crying girl... who looks like a model.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.95,0:19:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A sunflower.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.99,0:19:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This? It's my favorite, so it's practically all I wear.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.71,0:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.17,0:19:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it's really cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.30,0:19:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.59,0:19:52.85,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Models all have amazing contours \Nfrom their necks to their collarbones.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.85,0:19:53.97,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,You know a lot?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.97,0:19:56.85,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,A bit. I saw models a lot when I was little.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.85,0:19:57.44,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.15,0:20:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom used to be editor-in-chief of a fashion magazine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.77,0:20:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Neiru! Come look.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.07,0:20:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't her neck super pretty?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.07,0:20:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a model's.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.37,0:20:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. It's long and slender.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.41,0:20:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And no Adam's apple.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.33,0:20:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You like Adam's apples, too, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.88,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.25,0:20:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I like Adam's apples, too! They're sexy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.55,0:20:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they, though?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.63,0:20:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem so firm!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.01,0:20:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you mean!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.59,0:20:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.31,0:20:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How about my neck, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.47,0:20:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it nice and inviting?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.72,0:20:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a puppy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.77,0:20:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A puppy? A puppy?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.89,0:20:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow-wow-wow, lend me some cash.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.86,0:20:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.73,0:20:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't laugh.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.28,0:20:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But... Sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.04,0:21:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're laughing too much.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.13,0:21:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go buy Eggs.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.13,0:21:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.13,0:21:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Me? Sawaki Momoe.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.84,0:21:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.10,0:21:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.36,0:22:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
